  "_sText": "My First Plugin in HL Weapon Mod: M1 Garand,\u00a0a Semi Automatic Rifle<br><br>M1 Garand for HLDM Weapon Mod, based on DOD M1 Garand. M1 Garand is a Semi Automatic Rifle that was used in WW2 by the US Army as the primary weapon:<br><br>-> Weapon statistics:<br><br>Type: Semi Automatic Rifle<br><br>DMG: <span class=\"RedColor\"><span class=\"RedColor\"><span class=\"GreenColor\">High</span></span></span><br><br>ROF: N/A<br><br>Accuracy: <span class=\"GreenColor\">Good</span><br><br>Recoil: Medium<br><br>Clip: 8/80<br><br>Reload Speed: <span class=\"GreenColor\">Fast</span><br><br>Secondary Attack: Butt Stock Attack (Close Combat)<br><br>-> Special Ability:<br><br>1: Can Perform Close Combat by using Butt Stock Attack<br><br>2: Instant Kill for unarmored or low armored player<br><br>-> Note:\u00a0<span class=\"RedColor\"><br><br>1: Can't Reload until all clip out</span><br><br>2: This weapon has its own ammo, you need to spawn its ammo in HL Weapon Mod Spawn Editor plugin to collect it.\u00a0<br><br>-> Required: Module Weapon Mod, Plugin Weapon Mod Spawn Editor (Use to spawn new weapons and its ammo), AMX Mod X, HL 1.6<br><br>-> Instructions:<br><br>1: Please Install Amx Mod X , module HL Weapon Mod and plugin Weapon Mod Spawn Editor first. To Install module HL Weapon Mod and plugin Weapon Mod Spawn Editor,\u00a0<a href=\"https://forums.alliedmods.net/showthread.php?t=183369\" target=\"_blank\">go here</a>:<br><br>2: Extract all folder inside the folder in the directory that you have HLDM which contain Amx Mod X, module HL Weapon Mod and plugin Weapon Mod Spawn Editor<br><br>3: go to: .../addons/amxmodx/configs , open the file: plugins.ini, it's a txt file, and add this in the end line of this file:<br><br>wpn_garand.amxx debug<br><br>4: go to: .../sprites , open hud.txt , it's a txt file, add this in the end line of this file:<br><br>d_garand 640 640hud14ex 172 112 48 16<br><br>5: Open the HL.exe, choose the map you want to add new weapons here, use the plugin Weapon Mod Spawn Editor to add new weapon and its ammo<br><br>6: Done<br><br>-> Credits:<br><br>1:\u00a0Ratking\u00a0(DOD) (M1 Garand Skin and Sound)<br><br>2: Nexon CSO (Hud Weapon Sprites and Hud Death Sprites)<br><br>3: KORD_12.7 (Basic code)<br><br>4: Me (Optimized Code for using M1 Garand)<br><br>-> Video Showcase:<br><br><iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/VVbDDUbpIxQ\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"\"></iframe><br>If any problem or something that need to be improved, please pm to me. Enjoy<br><br>",
